{
  "_doc": "Recorded takes behind the recipes' sample layers (docs/AUDIO_PROCEDURAL.md 'Recorded samples'). Every source is CC0 1.0. tools/audio_import/import_samples.py fetches the mirror, cleans each file (mono 48 kHz, high-pass, trim, fades, level match per set) and writes assets/sounds/<name>_<n>.ogg plus assets/sounds/CREDITS.md. A name with takes plays one take per seed; its old single file (gen_assets.py placeholder) is then unused.",
